This product includes software developed at GetMCPAds (https://www.getmcpads.com).

An open-source Model Context Protocol server for Microsoft Advertising, using
the Bing Ads API. It is self-hosted and unaffiliated with Microsoft.

GetMCPAds also runs a managed gateway that covers Microsoft Advertising
alongside Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok Ads, Pinterest Ads, X Ads, Google
Analytics and Search Console, with hosted OAuth and cross-platform reporting:
https://www.getmcpads.com

---

src/schema.json and src/report-columns.json contain field and report column
